'''Kristane''' is a [[Pixies|pixie]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] [[Merchants|merchant]] that can be found near the [[Lakeshore]] [[Cooking Table]]. She sells exclusively [[Brawler]] [[Jobs|Job]] [[Items|items]].

==Sells==
*{{Member}}Rubber Match Brawler Shoulderpads
*{{Member}}Rubber Match Brawler Pants
*{{Member}}Rubber Match Brawler Helmet
*{{Member}}Rubber Match Brawler Gloves
*{{Member}}Rubber Match Brawler Boots
*{{Member}}Rubber Match Brawler Jacket
*[[Brawler's Power Shard of Regeneration III]]
*Brawler's Ring of Energy III
*Brawler's Necklace of Bark Skin III
*[[Brawler's Anvil Hammer of Dirt Kick]]
*[[Brawler's Anvil Hammer of Roundhouse]]
*[[Brawler's Anvil Hammer of Sweeps]]

==Trivia==
*Kristane was introduced in-game on August 6, 2013.
